okivarressa, Kolkinkosken rannalla. Alueella sijaitsee Kolkin kartano - yksi Vaasan alueen vanhimmista rakennuksista. Kolkin luontopolku tarjoaa helposti saavutettavan luontoelämyksenrauhallisessa ympäristössä. Polun varrella voit tutustua Kolkin vaiherikkaaseen historiaan ja nauttia nuotioherkuista laavulla. Koskella ja Kuljunsaaressa sijaitsee myös hyvät kalastusapajat. Lähtöpaikalta löytyy myös qr-koodit Vähänkyrön digitaalisille pyöräilyreiteille."},"route-name":{"fi":"Kolkin luontopolku"}}],"status":"active"}},"location":{"city":{"city-code":905,"neighborhood":"Vähäkyrö"},"address":"Vähäkyrö-talo, Vähänkyröntie 11","geometries":{"type":"FeatureCollection","features":[{"type":"Feature","geometry":{"type":"LineString","coordinates":[[21.944128,63.07818499999999,7.656],[21.944380000000002,63.07822999999999,7.51],[21.94452000000001,63.078097,7.732],[21.94416300000001,63.07791599999999,7.84],[21.944050000000004,63.077862999999994,8.097],[21.943803,63.07792299999999,7.194],[21.943669999999997,63.077878,7.654],[21.943507000000004,63.07789300000001,7.971],[21.943173999999996,63.077999,8.736],[21.943127000000008,63.077966999999994,9.101],[21.943261000000003,63.07788199999999,9.316],[21.943328,63.077837999999986,8.84],[21.94308999999999,63.07781799999999,9.19],[21.942954999999994,63.07791199999998,9.526],[21.942888999999997,63.077888,9.292],[21.942945999999996,63.077794,9.201],[21.942861,63.077775,8.959],[21.942720000000016,63.077842,8.803],[21.942437,63.07781999999999,7.804],[21.942393000000006,63.077807,7.779],[21.94244740518342,63.077695233148326,7.664],[21.94244714455105,63.077611460446334,7.565],[21.942351866844408,63.0775382544325,8.064],[21.942252840634165,63.07744748298418,8.313],[21.942167504189324,63.07738907676656,6.727],[21.94236438332116,63.077336528621224,6.154],[21.942671413163836,63.07742407573305,8.211],[21.94286232689465,63.07748739293488,8.079],[21.94321088044819,63.077551421949245,8.844],[21.943290495638227,63.07762393379406,8.943],[21.943595795711126